<title>MEXICO: Maizoro sets cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Maizoro sets cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican food company Maizoro said on Friday it will pay a cash dividend of 0.06052405572 peso per each of its 55,704,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company said through the Mexican stock market that the dividend was approved in its stockholder meeting on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Maizoro said the payment will be made in two parts, the first of 0.02821039781 peso after April 29 and the second of 0.0323136579 peso after Oct. 21.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9552))</p>
